    "title": "Siouxland United FC advances to NPSL North Confernce final with 4-1 win over Minnesota Blizzard FC, will host Duluth FC on Saturday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Mitchell ,\n1 hours ago\nSIOUX CITY, Iowa (KCAU) – Siouxland United broke a 1-1 halftime tie with a trio of goals after the break, punching its ticket to the NPSL North Conference finals with a 4-1 win over Minnesota Blizzard FC.\nThe Outlaws will host Duluth FC in Saturday’s conference final. Match time has yet to be determined.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KCAU 9 News | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
